# ============================================================================
# DXB Global OS — secret NAME registry (SEC-02 vault pattern)
# ============================================================================
# Convention:
#   - Real values live ONLY in the gitignored `.env`, created and filled by
#     the CEO by hand — never by an agent.
#   - Code and agents reference secrets by NAME only (process.env.NAME /
#     ${NAME}); this file is the discoverable, committed name registry.
#   - An agent needing a new secret adds its NAME here with the placeholder
#     and asks the CEO to fill `.env`.
#   - Every placeholder is the literal __SET_ME__ — never anything shaped
#     like a real key (no provider-prefix-shaped values, no sk-... shapes).
# Not registered here:
#   - 9Router: local software holding upstream keys, not a provider with its
#     own key.
#   - Account passwords (Google, Microsoft, Namecheap, hosting, WordPress,
#     sudo): live in the CEO's password manager, never in any env file.
# ============================================================================

# LLM providers
OPENAI_API_KEY=__SET_ME__
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=__SET_ME__
NVIDIA_API_KEY=__SET_ME__
OLLAMA_API_KEY=__SET_ME__
OPENCODE_API_KEY=__SET_ME__

# Infra
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=__SET_ME__
APIFY_TOKEN=__SET_ME__
